<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N = 5.11%				    O/N = 5.11%</p>
<p>	    T/N = 6.81%				    T/N = 5.11%</p>
<p>		   Sept 19, 1996			Sept 18, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  8.17%	1 month forward =  8.18%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  8.86%	2 month forward =  9.20%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  9.31%	3 month forward =  9.65%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward = 10.22%	4 month forward = 10.31%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward = 10.42%	5 month forward = 10.56%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward = 10.36%	6 month forward = 10.42%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
